    "title": "Pop Beat: Star Hits & Music",
    "description": "Welcome to Pop Beat, the ultimate mobile rhythm game! Tap to the beats of your favorite hits from artists like Billie Eilish, Sia, Arctic Monkeys, The Killers, and Maroon 5. Enjoy a diverse selection of tracks across genres and eras, perfect for all music lovers.\r\n\r\n*FEATURES:*\r\n- \ud83c\udfb5 *Popular Songs*: Play hits from top artists including Billie Eilish, Sia, Arctic Monkeys, The Killers, Maroon 5, Franz Ferdinand, Avicii, Justin Bieber, and Miley Cyrus.\r\n- \ud83c\udfae *Engaging Gameplay*: Test your reflexes and timing with intuitive tap and swipe controls.\r\n- \ud83c\udfa7 *Variety of Genres*: From pop and rock to electronic and indie, discover new favorites.\r\n\r\nPop Beat is designed for players of all skill levels. Feel the rhythm, tap to the beat, and become a music superstar!\r\n\r\n*Note:*\r\n- Free to download and play, with optional in-app purchases available.\r\n\r\nDownload now and start your musical journey with Pop Beat!",
